13
00:02:15.719 --> 00:02:17.095
For others

14
00:02:17.304 --> 00:02:19.431
Love is simply lost.

15
00:02:25.229 --> 00:02:29.274
But then, of course,
love can also be found.

16
00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:32.653
Even if just for the night.

17
00:02:37.658 --> 00:02:39.826
And then there's
another kind of love.

18
00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:41.495
The cruelest kind.

19
00:02:41.703 --> 00:02:44.414
The one that almost kills its victims.

20
00:02:44.623 --> 00:02:47.501
It's called unrequited love.

21
00:02:47.668 --> 00:02:51.755
Of that, I am an expert..

22
00:02:52.256 --> 00:02:56.093
Most love stories are about people
who fall in love with each other.

23
00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:59.555
But what about the rest of us?
What about our stories?

24
00:02:59.763 --> 00:03:02.182
Those of us who fall in love alone.

25
00:03:02.766 --> 00:03:05.477
