of the one-sided affair.

26
00:03:05.686 --> 00:03:07.521
We are the cursed
of the loved ones.

27
00:03:07.771 --> 00:03:10.440
We are the unloved ones.
The walking wounded.

28
00:03:10.649 --> 00:03:14.152
